WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.846
In this video, you will finish your contest.

00:00:02.846 --> 00:00:08.337
You will check the results, close voting, and announce the winners, and see what everyone else sees.

00:00:08.337 --> 00:00:09.424
We start on the map.

00:00:10.325 --> 00:00:12.074
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.358
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:19.139 --> 00:00:20.120
Then tap Allow.

00:00:23.949 --> 00:00:27.187
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:27.187 --> 00:00:30.012
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:30.012 --> 00:00:34.780
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:35.192
Tap it.

00:00:36.808 --> 00:00:38.706
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:40.355 --> 00:00:43.769
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:44.469 --> 00:00:45.387
Tap Mine.

00:00:47.283 --> 00:00:48.861
This is your personal page.

00:00:48.861 --> 00:00:54.046
It lists the contests you run, if you run any, and the homes you entered, with their status.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.819
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:58.629 --> 00:01:02.042
This opens your dashboard, the control room for your contest.

00:01:02.742 --> 00:01:06.073
When voting is over, it is time to announce the winners.

00:01:06.073 --> 00:01:06.774
Tap Results.

00:01:08.452 --> 00:01:13.529
This shows who would win if you announced today, in every category, so there are no surprises.

00:01:14.431 --> 00:01:17.631
Tap Download results to save everything to a spreadsheet.

00:01:19.635 --> 00:01:22.430
It is a good idea to keep a copy for your records.

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:26.298
When you are ready, tap Close voting and announce winners.

00:01:28.078 --> 00:01:31.129
It asks you to tap again, because this cannot be undone.

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:36.287
Once you confirm, the results are saved and locked.

00:01:36.287 --> 00:01:43.298
Everyone who entered is emailed, and so are your judges and you, and the winners get a congratulations message.

00:01:43.298 --> 00:01:44.800
Voters are not emailed.

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:52.937
If voting has not started, nobody has voted, or the judges are not finished, the button first asks, Announce anyway, as a warning.

00:01:53.839 --> 00:01:57.060
To see what everyone else sees, tap See it as voters do.

00:01:58.936 --> 00:02:01.274
Here are the winners, with their awards.

00:02:01.274 --> 00:02:07.149
Winning homes keep a crown on the map and in their owners' profiles, so the recognition lasts all year.

00:02:36.423 --> 00:02:38.727
Next up: Read your contest activity.
